<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Amelia" data-copy-zh="Amelia">Amelia</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Amelia’s healer-hut schedule, Willow-linked dates, two conversations and healing lessons." data-copy-zh="查找Amelia的治疗师小屋行程、与Willow相连的约会、两段交心及治疗课程。">Find Amelia’s healer-hut schedule, Willow-linked dates, two conversations and healing lessons.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Date_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Higher-Point_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Quiet_Pillar"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Healer.27s_Craft"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Healer's_Craft"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Community_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Amelia — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/amelia.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Amelia — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/amelia.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Amelia — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Amelia offers a compact relationship route alongside healing lessons. Her first outing depends on Willow’s supply arrangement, rather than affection alone.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Where_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Her portrait is at Village Healer's Hut every day 06:00–21:00. Dates and conversations have narrower start windows in the tables.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Meet her at the hut, raise Known 25 for The Healer's Craft, then Close Friend 200 for The Quiet Pillar. Complete them in that order.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Healer's Hut</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Village Healer's Hut; 06:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Healer's Craft</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Village Healer's Hut; Known (25); 09:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 20 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Quiet Pillar</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Village Healer's Hut; Close Friend (200); after The Healer's Craft; 09:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 20 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>To unlock Nature Walk Date, complete A Fair Supply: Willow must be active staff and home, Willow at Friend 100, Amelia at Acknowledged 10, and Amelia’s introduction completed. The outing itself needs Acquaintance 50,09:00–15:00.</p><p>Sunset Walk follows the nature walk at Friend 100,18:00–20:00. It restores 10 Calm while spending 30 Energy.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Actions"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Village Healer's Hut; during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Healing Philosophy</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Village Healer's Hut; Known (25); Communication 55</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+11 direct affection; Intelligence +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Nature Walk Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Village Healer's Hut; Acquaintance (50); after A Fair Supply; 09:00–14:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; 40 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sunset Walk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Village Healer's Hut; Friend (100); after Nature Walk with Amelia; 18:00–19:59; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; 30 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sacred Mending</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Village Healer's Hut; Romantic (800); Mystic 60; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">350 min; 180 Energy; 100 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">learn Sacred Mending once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Healer's Rest</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Village Healer's Hut; affection 1000; 09:00–17:59; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+50 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Care We Share</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Village Healer's Hut; In Love (3000); 06:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 Field Medicine; once per run</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Sacred Mending teaches Sacred Mending once at Romantic 800/Mystic 60. Bring 180 Energy and 100 Calm for the 350-minute lesson; its content lock is separate.</p><p>At In Love 3000, The Care We Share awards 1 Field Medicine once per run with no time or material cost.</p><p>A Healer's Rest is separate repeatable content at 1000 affection,09:00–18:00;90 min/30 Energy,50 base affection, once/day.</p><p>Favorite stats are Intelligence, Charm, Cooking. Learning Master Chef improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>If Nature Walk is absent, check Willow’s employment and the completed supply-arrangement scene.</li><li>The second heart-to-heart needs the first conversation completed.</li><li>Already learned skills disappear from the lesson menu. Vacation can move relevant shared-route participants away.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-willow.html">Willow and the supply arrangement</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships and intimacy</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">Army skills and Field Medicine</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Skills</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Date_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Higher-Point_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Quiet_Pillar"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Healer.27s_Craft"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Healer's_Craft"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Community_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Amelia 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/amelia.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Amelia 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/amelia.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Amelia 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Amelia的路线较精简，另有治疗课程。首次出游需要先完成Willow的供货约定，不能只靠提高好感解锁。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Where_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>每天06:00–21:00可在村庄治疗师小屋找到她。约会和交心的开始时段更窄，见下表。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先在小屋见面。达到已知25可进行治疗师的手艺；完成后，达到亲密朋友200再进行静默的支柱。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">治疗师的小屋</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">村庄治疗师小屋；06:00–20:59</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">治疗师的手艺</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">村庄治疗师小屋；已知（25好感）；09:00–16:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；20精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">静默的支柱</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">村庄治疗师小屋；亲密朋友（200好感）；完成：治疗师的手艺；09:00–16:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；20精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>自然散步约会要求先完成公道的供给：Willow已启用为员工并留在青楼，Willow达到朋友100、Amelia达到已遇见10，且已完成Amelia初次事件。出游本身要求相识50，在09:00–15:00开始。</p><p>完成自然散步后，朋友100可在18:00–20:00开始日落散步，消耗30精力并恢复10镇定。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Actions"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">村庄治疗师小屋；头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">行医理念</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">村庄治疗师小屋；已知（25好感）；沟通55</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+11；智力+1；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">自然散步约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">村庄治疗师小屋；相识（50好感）；完成：公道的供给；09:00–14:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；40精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">日落散步</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">村庄治疗师小屋；朋友（100好感）；完成：和 Amelia 的自然漫步；18:00–19:59；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；30精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">圣愈之术</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">村庄治疗师小屋；浪漫感（800好感）；神秘60；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">350分钟；180精力；100镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">学习圣愈之术，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">治疗师的歇息</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">村庄治疗师小屋；好感1000；09:00–17:59；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+50；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我们分享的关怀</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">村庄治疗师小屋；恋爱中（3000好感）；06:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">0分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">战地医疗+1；本轮仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>圣愈之术要求浪漫感800、神秘60，仅能学习一次；350分钟，消耗180精力、100镇定，另须满足内容权限。</p><p>恋爱中3000可进行我们分享的关怀，战地医疗+1，本轮仅一次，不消耗时间或材料。</p><p>治疗师的歇息是独立的重复活动，要求1000好感、09:00–18:00；消耗90分钟、30精力，增加50基础好感，每天一次。</p><p>偏好的属性为智力、魅力、烹饪。学会厨艺大师可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>自然散步不出现时，检查Willow是否在职，以及供货约定事件是否完成。</li><li>第二次交心要求第一次已完成。</li><li>已学会的技能会从课程菜单消失；相关角色度假时，共同事件也可能暂时无法进行。</li></ul></section>
